{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本前AV女優三上悠亞引退後，於2025年震撼加盟台灣職籃福爾摩沙夢想家啦啦隊「Formosa Sexy」，一舉一動都是外界關注焦點。</p><p>10月17日三上悠亞現身台灣臺中洲際迷你蛋，為夢想家新賽季主場開幕戰熱力應援。怎料，疑因衣服尺寸不合，舞蹈過程中數度險些走光，讓現場粉絲看得相當驚險！</p><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞疑表演服太小件，應援時險些走光。（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188817955173961728248963.jpeg/9_qR4OtRtg4D3w1QKM6AkENJyvZWMq5YQSWg_kEloP4\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞疑表演服太小件，應援時險些走光。（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）</figcaption></figure><p>三上悠亞應援險走光　上衣下滑狂拉衣自救</p><figure><img alt=\"10月17日三上悠亞她現身臺中洲際迷你蛋，為夢想家新賽季主場開幕戰熱力應援。（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188818503151390720607428.png/drjRHRZVzu1rdhiRgKBAmEf118RneEtbyMinKsjIpyo\"/><figcaption>10月17日三上悠亞她現身臺中洲際迷你蛋，為夢想家新賽季主場開幕戰熱力應援。（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"怎料，疑因衣服尺寸不合，舞蹈過程中數度險些走光，讓現場粉絲看得相當驚險！（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188818505563246592905723.png/_BEum9DLBbuN6-Av9arKWcztjSG_57U-HTiN6R04jek\"/><figcaption>怎料，疑因衣服尺寸不合，舞蹈過程中數度險些走光，讓現場粉絲看得相當驚險！（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞當天身穿白色斜肩緊身短版上衣，搭配白色百褶裙與頭上的大蝴蝶結亮相。（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188818507891216384139506.png/oWZDBda1JXbo1oFzTPYJbsTBA49qCQjcZfSx3WX0sd0\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞當天身穿白色斜肩緊身短版上衣，搭配白色百褶裙與頭上的大蝴蝶結亮相。（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"隨著音樂響起，她擺動身體、動作相當俐落有活力，但隨著舞蹈動作幅度加大，上衣開始頻頻下滑，導致豐滿上圍多次險些走光。（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188818510194020352073125.png/IFwOOyweXJcXisQ08mLcYV-edQTBKw8OaKhvPGiobzw\"/><figcaption>隨著音樂響起，她擺動身體、動作相當俐落有活力，但隨著舞蹈動作幅度加大，上衣開始頻頻下滑，導致豐滿上圍多次險些走光。（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞見狀連忙邊跳舞、邊伸手將衣服往上拉調整，好在內層有搭配安全內著防護，才並未發生走光意外。（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188818512563933184019648.png/u5HR902hb32bq2q-ZXan84YPhEC8F5Hh0-7wkdPu8JE\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞見狀連忙邊跳舞、邊伸手將衣服往上拉調整，好在內層有搭配安全內著防護，才並未發生走光意外。（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188818505097547776269148.jpeg/MUtWhFeZ3R2NhUZfnGI8qPcpZ9z7ieQF8bgkHfG4JB0\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188818507865919488624153.jpeg/htQ_N-PxOAw3SuZZIB6dpEPiionuf79roZHzsKGR87A\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188818510378438656167309.jpeg/q6GkjzXVmf5p6x42koX6ehqT2oB8mMtB84mHo_OJh6M\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188818513100673024432086.jpeg/2vaCrxvt5F1dj5a0_qJUl2QwqeZU0nWDgUlU3oFJVN4\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188818515646746624609521.jpeg/Ma7SI8R6XFMcUziFaTiNNO-HI8q0Ce_D6RZPbukWT24\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188818485237518336259164.jpeg/7J2Yt649O2W2-yKAnzV9eO2vCmkqr4bsg5hFNIOYRTQ\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞（Instagram@chia.cheng.224）</figcaption></figure><p>三上悠亞當天身穿白色斜肩緊身短版上衣，搭配白色百褶裙與頭上的大蝴蝶結亮相。隨著音樂響起，她擺動身體、動作相當俐落有活力，但隨著舞蹈動作幅度加大，上衣開始頻頻下滑，導致豐滿上圍多次險些走光。三上悠亞見狀連忙邊跳舞、邊伸手將衣服往上拉調整，好在內層有搭配安全內著防護，才並未發生走光意外。</p><p>雖然受到服裝尺寸過小與設計影響，但三上悠亞全程依然展現極高專業度，臨危不亂地保持招牌甜美笑容完成舞曲，敬業態度獲得大批粉絲讚賞。事實上，夢想家啦啦隊Formosa Sexy一向主打性感路線，隊服多以貼身、短版與高裁剪的設計為主，雖然能完美展現團員們的火辣身材與精湛舞姿，但過去也曾因尺度過大而多次引發外界討論。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：三上悠亞節目自爆新屋天價裝修費嚇呆日本藝人：確定不是樓價？】三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092823498641903616302518.jpeg/JRVlp7OKBe7qEo7lFGBWPCXnh8Ml3IupVYQ_rVWEP60\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：三上悠亞節目自爆新屋天價裝修費嚇呆日本藝人：確定不是樓價？】三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092824481375719424318420.jpeg/fs9A490jw4npmEndOfnljHFPhy8ZKG8Yi3VNrot1Ta4\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092824485985521664027369.jpeg/OtJXjHn9bYc7x77D-_GFqe-go9s83PpYJS_WtiUv1rY\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092824487679889408691834.jpeg/UjY5VhhXCg-EF9tyaifLeiRSWyAZLyQsxLB-DsSwfg4\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092824487088492544826019.jpeg/XsNSvOq875nSayqSQj9OTIdvmwbaWBnVWQBqC1kAags\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092824489416462336167854.jpeg/mvswTIyFOise68UlDXyp_si9u-rJ_TPBi_d3tYv3d7U\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092824493787189248615843.jpeg/uJkdoK1uwWdfQQgwVCwAll0O7XA1rFRPGdaKmxnWips\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092824483724660736902873.jpeg/RmKwWP38sAuAdxzIUJBOtJVas7_uNO_NbvIjKm7yIyo\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞（Instagram@yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cd